> 2.55.0
>

Summary of the most serious issues:

 - `ctlv_attestation_evidence_get_action()` decode path leaks resolved blobs
   (`ctlv_blob_put` never called) on the unknown-format and duplicate-format
   error paths.
 - `mr_read_query`'s ESTALE check, `att->mr_read_generation` and the new doc
   paragraph are dead: the op never paginates.
 - `MR_EXTEND` commits the extension and can then fail the reply with
   `-EMSGSIZE`, so the client sees an error for a completed extend.
 - Unneeded `EXPORT_SYMBOL_NS_GPL` of `op_pre`/`op_post` (same module).
 - Redundant blob length check, ids[256] only safe if the schema limit is
   enforced, 32-bit truncation of forged cursors in `log_get`, unvalidated
   selection ids, duplicated code (id range checks, next-entry loop).
 - Commit message does not describe exports/doc change.
